---
import Main from "../layouts/Main.astro";
---

<Main title="About Me">
    <div id="content">
        <div id="image">
            <img
                src="image.png"
                alt=""
            />
        </div>
        <div id="text">
            <p>
                My names Dylan Curry, im a games developer based in <a
                    href="https://maps.app.goo.gl/yehFP3PC7qg4KscW6"
                    >Salford, Manchester</a
                >
            </p>
            <h1>My Education</h1>
            <p>
                In year 10 i joined the <a
                    href="https://www.utcmediacityuk.org.uk/">UTC@MediaCityUK</a
                > inorder to study Games Design, Computer science and digital information
                technology.
            </p>
            After completing my GCSE's and moving to highschool, i continued at the
            UTC inorder to study a Level 3 BTEC in Games design, which is what i
            am currently studying

            <!-- <h1>My work</h1>
            <p>
                I have developed a game called <a
                    href="/projects/The Meta Menaces">The Meta Menaces</a
                > for a client. My client was Simon Horton, the Co-Founder and CEO
                of Iconika and creator of the Meta Menaces IP. He requested that
                i develop a 3D FPS game, set in 1466 and in the Meta Menaces universe
            </p> -->
            <h1>My hobbies</h1>
            <p>
                In my free time, I love to boulder and game. Some of my
                favourite games are Minecraft, Stardew valley and Team Fortress
                2 and i'll usually be playing one of these if im not in the
                climbing gym.
            </p>
        </div>
    </div>
</Main>

<style lang="scss">
    @use "../style/consts";

    $width: 9em;

    #image {
        width: $width;
        height: $width;
        overflow: hidden;
        border-radius: $width;
        border: solid consts.$Accent 0.2em;
        border-bottom: solid consts.$Accent 0.4em;
        margin-top: 0em;

        transition: margin 0.3s ease;

        @media (max-width: consts.$VerticalModePX*1.5) {
            margin-top: 1em;
        }

        img {
            width: $width * 1.3;
            justify-content: center;
            align-items: center;
        }
    }

    #content {
        display: flex;
        justify-content: center;
        align-items: center;
        flex-direction: column;
    }

    #text {
        margin-left: 1em;
        margin-right: 1em;
        max-width: 90vw;
        overflow: scroll;
        display: flex;
        text-wrap: wrap;
        justify-content: center;
        align-items: center;
        flex-direction: column;
        width: consts.$width/2;
    }
</style>
